MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_001: Deplorable! To commit a heinous deed such as that.\nIt's unacceptable!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_002: What's all the ruckus in here—hang on, is that\nYang Jie?
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_003: What's up with this kid?
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_004: Ah, Loretta! You will not believe what I just heard.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_005: This young man was in service to a wealthy lord\nwhen he was suddenly let go for a simple error.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_006: What's worse, the lord deceived him and saddled\nhim with huge debts in the process.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_007: It's true. I haven't found another job since, so I'm\nliving hand to mouth.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_008: What the hell?! There sure are some rotten eggs\nin this world!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_009: Unfortunately you're right. I refuse to stand by and\nallow such tyranny to go unpunished!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_010: This doesn't fly with me either. We gotta\ndo something!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_011: Yes. That lord must be punished for his inexcusable\nactions.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_012: Um... I don't know if violence is necessary here...
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_013: Oh, don't worry. We will not take his life. Just tell us\nwhere this liar lives.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_014: Over there. Those must be the estate's guards.\nI doubt we can settle this peacefully. What now?
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_015: What do you mean "what now"? We've come too\nfar to let a couple guards stop us!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_016: I hoped you would say that. Onward!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_017: Hm? Who the hell are you guys?! Waaah!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_018: Damn, does it feel good to make a difference!\nYou know what I mean?
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_019: Hyahaha! Indeed. What a satisfying fight! Those\nguards were almost too easy to take down.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_020: And after our conversation with that dishonorable\nlord, I believe he'll leave that young man alone.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_021: Especially since we made him cancel the debt.\nI call this a day well spent!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_022: I couldn't have done it without your assistance,\nLoretta...or your fiercely kind heart.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_023: Aw, enough with that stuff. You've got a pretty good\nheart yourself!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_C_024: Yes, we make a good team. Together we could stamp\nout all kinds of evil in this world.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_001: Oh no, not those two! I'd better run before I get\ncaught up in some trouble.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_002: You get the feeling people are starting to cross the\nstreet when they see us?
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_003: How did things end up like this? We're only trying\nto help.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_004: Indeed. The other day I simply protected some fields\nfrom a group of bandits set on ravaging them.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_005: Yeah...but it was kinda scary when you ripped out\nthat stump and started swinging it around.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_006: Hm, I was only trying to frighten them a little. And\nit worked beautifully. They turned right around.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_007: I dunno. It might've been a little much. We should\nprobably lay off.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_008: Here I thought I was doing some good for once,\nand everyone hates me for it. Go figure.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_009: Do not despair. Unseen virtuous deeds often beget\nbright recompense.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_010: Say what? You gotta dumb it down for me.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_011: It means good deeds are often rewarded, though one\nmay not always recognize those rewards right away.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_012: Hmmm. You think so? Well, I guess we weren't doing\nit for a reward anyway.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_013: Um, hi! Long time no see!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_014: It's the young man who inspired it all. How are you\ndoing now?
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_015: Good! I cut ties with that lord. If we met in the street\nnow, he'd be the one trying to avoid me.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_016: And after that, I was lucky enough to land a good\njob. It's at the restaurant near here. Do you know it?
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_017: Of course! Their dishes are excellent and full of fresh\nvegetables. Congratulations.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_018: Come over and have a meal! I owe you, so it's on\nthe house.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_019: Delicious AND free? Sign me up!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_020: It seems our reward came sooner than expected.\nHelping others is a blessing in itself.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_021: Yeah! You were right on the money.
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_022: I'm gonna have a dish for every single person I've\nhelped lately!
MID_SE_Lor_Yan_B_023: Well, that's not exactly what I meant... She may have\nmissed the forest for the food.